{"speciesId":786,"names":{"fr":"Tokopiyon","es":"Tapu Lele","en":"Tapu Lele","ja":"カプ・テテフ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Pokémon candide mais terriblement cruel, c’est le gardien d’Akala. Il puise son énergie dans le parfum entêtant des fleurs."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"El espíritu guardián de Akala, tan inocente como cruel. La fragancia de las flores constituye su fuente de energía."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"This guardian deity of Akala is guilelessly cruel. The fragrant aroma of flowers is the source of its energy."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"無邪気で 残酷な アーカラの 守り神。 花の 芳しい 香りが エネルギーの 源。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Avec ses ailes délicates, il répand une poudre mystérieuse et lumineuse quand il vole. Il suffit de le toucher pour retrouver aussitôt le sourire."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Al revolotear esparce escamas que desprenden un brillo misterioso. Se dice que todo aquel que las toca vuelve a sentirse pletórico al instante."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"As it flutters about, it scatters its strangely glowing scales. Touching them is said to restore good health on the spot."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ヒラヒラ 飛びまわり 不思議に 光る 鱗粉を 振りまく。 触れた者は たちまち 元気を 取り戻すという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"C’est le gardien d’Akala. Il saupoudre une pluie d’écailles scintillantes sur les humains et les Pokémon blessés pour les soigner."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Esparce escamas brillantes que curan a las personas y los Pokémon. En la isla de Akala es venerado como su espíritu guardián."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It heals the wounds of people and Pokémon by sprinkling them with its sparkling scales. This guardian deity is worshiped on Akala."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"輝く りん粉を 振りまいて 人や ポケモンの 傷を 癒す。 アーカラで 祀られる 守り神だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Bien qu’on le considère comme une divinité protectrice, cette incarnation parfaite de la nature est aussi innocente que cruelle."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Este espíritu guardián es tan candoroso como despiadado, por lo que se podría decir que es la encarnación de la naturaleza misma."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Although called a guardian deity, Tapu Lele is devoid of guilt about its cruel disposition and can be described as nature incarnate."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"守り神と 呼ばれるが 無邪気で 残酷な 性質も 併せ持つ 自然の化身と いえる 存在。"}],"varieties":[{"id":786,"moves":[{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[17,"level-up",14],[18,"level-up",14],[20,"level-up",20]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"confusion","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"psychic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"withdraw","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"reflect","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psywave","learns":[[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",8]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thief","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"snore","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"protect","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"endure","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"charm","learns":[[20,"machine",0